'' 'procptr( val )' OVER A PROGRAM'S OWN 'sub val' is that sub, not the runtime's VAL -- fbcunit
'' registers a TEST named val that way, and tiko handed the runner fb_VAL's address: an access
'' violation (fbc's functions/fixstr_arg.bas). Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/procptr-user-over-rtl.bas -o tests/codegen/procptruseroverrtl.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/procptruseroverrtl.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: user val
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: user val
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: main
